格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH compatibility plugin for redundant same-mode sandbox escalation requests","id":"gh:1333681368","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop","slug":"zhangzujian/dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH compatibility plugin for redundant same-mode sandbox escalation requests"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-same-mode-sandbox-noop"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A removable compatibility plugin for DeepSeek Harness / DSH `0.1.0-rc.6`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"That release rejects a tool call when `sandbox_permissions` names a mode that\nis already covered by "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"the call's effective sandbox mode:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The plugin wraps both `ctx.tools.execute()` and the rc.6 Agent Loop scheduler's\npreparation entry po"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"int before DSH snapshots and freezes tool arguments. For\n`bash`, `pwsh`, `write`, and `edit`, it rem"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"oves the paired\n`sandbox_permissions` and `justification` fields when the requested mode is\nequal to"},{"id":"p6s4","text":" or narrower than the calling session's effective mode. The original\nruntime then executes the call "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"under its standing policy. For example, a\n`workspace-write` request in a `danger-full-access` sessio"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"n is not an\nescalation, so the redundant pair is removed."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Genuinely wider requests, unknown modes, malformed argument pairs, unrelated\ntools, and calls withou"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"t escalation fields pass to DSH unchanged. For a known\nnon-escalating request, an empty justificatio"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"n is removed with the redundant\npermission fields before DSH validates it; for a genuinely wider req"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"uest, the\nsame empty justification remains subject to DSH's original validation.\nDisposal restores t"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"he original runtime methods."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"This is an out-of-tree compatibility workaround. Prefer a DSH release that\nhandles non-escalating re"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"quests in the shared sandbox escalation layer when one\nis available."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install into a DSH profile"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Until this package is published to npm, clone it and add the local directory:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The package declares a DSH bundle, so `dsh plugin` adds its patch layer to the\nprofile automatically"},{"id":"p12s2","text":". Restart `dsh web` after installation."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"To remove it:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"For a one-off local overlay without profile installation, insert the plugin by\nfile URL in a patch l"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"oaded after the base bundle:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Test"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Unit tests require only Node.js:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Integration tests run against an installed DSH tree:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`DSH_INSTALL_DIR` is the directory containing `node_modules/@deepseek-ai`."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
